      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        310.10772705078125,
        527.0030517578125,
        323.25274658203125
      ],
      "text": "The Burhan trial and the Rienthong study are outliers for their sensitivities compared with the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
